#   measured). This cut exists only to carry the CM051-side seal fix, so 
#   re-pinning the daemon would rebuild and re-notarise a binary nobody 
#   changed. CM051 moves to current main because v1.0.46 shipped BEFORE #1085 
#   landed: the artefact carried 45 timestamp-mode .pyc while the fix sat on 
